; Three `not_member`s, one per near-miss, and no `wrong_underlying`
; anywhere — the half of the contract a bare "did it complain?" check
; would miss. A fractional magnitude is the interesting one: it is not a
; spelling the loader could ever have derived, and it still reports as a
; membership failure rather than a shape failure.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code not_member :path [texture view])
  (diagnostic :code not_member :path [texture view])
  (diagnostic :code not_member :path [texture view]))
